      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Designate Bellflower Crop",
      "actions": 3,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Nolly designates an ally within 30 feet as a member of her Bellflower crop. Nolly can have up to 10 members in her crop at once; any member added in excess of this number automatically removes a crop member of Nolly's choice. When Nolly or a member of her crop Aids a crop member and rolls a success, they get a critical success to Aid instead.\n\nWhen a crop member within 60 feet of Nolly fails a saving throw against an effect that would impose the Confused or Paralyzed condition, the crop member can use a reaction to reroll the saving throw and use the better of the two results. This is a fortune effect."
